## 2. Architecture Decision: Single Source of Truth

### Recommendation: **HTML-Only Storage with Markdown Paste Support**

After analysis, I recommend **HTML-only storage** as the canonical format because:

| Aspect | HTML-Only | Markdown-Only | Hybrid |
|--------|-----------|---------------|--------|
| Editor compatibility | ✅ TipTap native | ❌ Requires conversion | ❌ Complex |
| Rich text fidelity | ✅ Full styling | ❌ Limited | ✅ Full |
| Round-trip stability | ✅ No data loss | ❌ Conversion loss | ❌ Risk |
| Storage simplicity | ✅ Single format | ✅ Single format | ❌ Dual format |
| Paste handling | ✅ Convert on paste | ✅ Native | ❌ Complex |

